<tr>
<td>
<table class="ou-snippet-program-card"><caption>Snippet: Program Card</caption>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Major</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Aerospace Engineering</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<ul>
<li><a href="{{f:22192582}}">All Programs</a></li>
<li><a href="{{f:21723039}}">College of Engineering</a></li>
<li><a href="{{d:3473654}}">Aerospace Engineering</a></li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<p>The Bachelor of Science (BS) in aerospace engineering is an ideal fit if you're passionate about designing or analyzing aircraft and spacecraft. You'll have access to some of the best aerospace facilities in the country &mdash; and the chance to work and research with faculty and industry professionals on campus and throughout Wichita, known as the "Air Capital of the World."</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<h3 class="heading4">Learn how aerospace engineering is the right fit for you.</h3>
<table class="ou-snippet-generic-button-collection"><caption>Button Collection</caption>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-select-list="buttons">landing-panel__buttons button-collection--accent-first</td>
<td><a class="button" href="https://slate.wichita.edu/register/ugrfi">Request Info </a> <a class="button" href="https://my.wsu-info.org/apply-get-started">Start Your Application</a></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
<td>&nbsp;
